ngt", "type": "word", "start": 28.28, "end": 28.48}, {"text": "het", "type": "word", "start": 28.52, "end": 28.56}, {"text": "water", "type": "word", "start": 28.64, "end": 28.88}, {"text": "omhoog,", "type": "word", "start": 28.96, "end": 29.76}, {"text": "door", "type": "word", "start": 29.84, "end": 29.92}, {"text": "de", "type": "word", "start": 30, "end": 30.08}, {"text": "vaatbundels.", "type": "word", "start": 30.16, "end": 31.2}, {"text": "Koolstofdie-oxide", "type": "word", "start": 31.44, "end": 32.56}, {"text": "komt", "type": "word", "start": 32.64, "end": 32.8}, {"text": "uit", "type": "word", "start": 32.88, "end": 32.96}, {"text": "de", "type": "word", "start": 33, "end": 33.04}, {"text": "lucht.", "type": "word", "start": 33.12, "end": 33.52}, {"text": "Het", "type": "word", "start": 33.84, "end": 33.92}, {"text": "gaat", "type": "word", "start": 34, "end": 34.16}, {"text": "het", "type": "word", "start": 34.24, "end": 34.32}, {"text": "blad", "type": "word", "start": 34.36, "end": 34.56}, {"text": "in", "type": "word", "start": 34.64, "end": 34.8}, {"text": "door", "type": "word", "start": 34.88, "end": 35.12}, {"text": "piepkleine", "type": "word", "start": 35.2, "end": 35.68}, {"text": "gaatjes:", "type": "word", "start": 35.76, "end": 36.72}, {"text": "huidmondjes.", "type": "word", "start": 36.76, "end": 37.92}], "text": "Een plant eet niet. Hij maakt zijn eigen voedsel, met licht. Dat heet fotosynthese. Foto betekent licht, synthese betekent maken. Daarvoor zijn drie dingen nodig: licht, water en koolstofdie-oxide. De wortels halen water uit de grond. Daarin zitten ook mineralen: stoffen zoals in plantenvoeding uit de winkel. Die heeft de plant nodig, in kleine beetjes. Maar het is geen eten. De stengel brengt het water omhoog, door de vaatbundels. Koolstofdie-oxide komt uit de lucht. Het gaat het blad in door piepkleine gaatjes: huidmondjes."}